concern for others above everything; excellent attention skills. Those are not yet discussed. So we can bring those in to strengthen C. Also we can compare with other candidates. Perhaps we can support C but note concerns about communication and egocentric, but also note that C puts concern for others above everything, which mitigates egocentric? Actually contradictory. But we can argue that the positive crew atmosphere and concern for others suggests good crew cooperation, outweighing communication difficulty. Also we can bring attention skills as evidence for attention and information accuracy.\n\nThus we can say: I agree with Sarah, recommend C, add that C also has excellent attention skills and puts concern for others above everything, supporting crew cooperation and attention. The concerns about communication and egocentric are noted but less critical than reliability and decision quality. So we maintain vote for C.\n\nWe must output PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON.\n\nLet's craft."}
